    <!-- CONTENT START --><p>Recent CFA judgments in decided cases handed down within the current or last month can be found on the <a href="/en/work/cases/recent/index.html">Recent Judgments</a> page.</p>
<p>Older judgments can be found on the <a href="/en/work/cases/judgments/index.html">Judgments in Decided Cases</a> page. This page links to the searchable HKLII database. There is usually a time lag of a few days between the date of handing down of a CFA judgment and its publication on the HKLII website. Accordingly, on a particular date, this page may not contain all of the CFA judgments. You are advised to check the <a href="/en/work/cases/recent/index.html">Recent Judgments</a> page for those judgments that may not yet have been included in the searchable HKLII database.</p>
<p><a href="/en/work/cases/archive/index.html">Archived Judgments</a> contains a separate database of CFA judgments handed down since 1 January 2015 after transfer from <a href="/en/work/cases/recent/index.html">Recent Judgments</a>. It is not a comprehensive database of all CFA judgments.</p>    <!-- CONTENT END -->
